<title>UK: Merrill Lynch leads $276,159 mln asset backed bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch leads $276,159 mln asset backed bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch has lead-managed a $276,159 million home equity loan asset-backed bond with a legal final maturity in January 2007.  </p>
<p>BORROWER MERRILL LYNCH REVOLVING HOME EQUITY LOAN ASSET-BACKED</p>
<p>	    CERTIFICATES</p>
<p> AMT    $276,159	SPREAD     +17 BP    LEG MAT	  JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE  1M $LIBOR	PAY DATE    25.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 AVE LIFE    3.5 YRS</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 REOFFER    PAR</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS GLOBAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  TAX PROVS  STD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
